  "description": "This 3D model features a historical cannon, reminiscent of those used in the 18th and 19th centuries. The cannon is mounted on a robust wooden carriage, complete with four sturdy wheels, allowing for mobility on various terrains. The barrel of the cannon is made of cast iron, showcasing realistic textures and metallic reflections that emphasize its age and usage.\n\nThe wooden carriage is meticulously detailed, displaying wood grain textures and a worn finish that suggests extensive use in historical battles or fort defenses. The iron cannon barrel includes subtle engravings and structural details, adding to the model's authenticity and historical accuracy.\n\nPerfect for historical reenactments, educational purposes, or as a prop in period-themed games and animations, this model brings a piece of history to life with detailed craftsmanship and realistic textures.",
